oltpConfig.setMaximumPoolSize(40);
oltpConfig.setMinimumIdle(10);
oltpConfig.setConnectionTimeout(2000);
oltpConfig.setIdleTimeout(300000);
HikariDataSource oltpDataSource = new HikariDataSource(oltpConfig);

// Reporting/Analytics pool
HikariConfig reportConfig = new HikariConfig();
reportConfig.setMaximumPoolSize(10);
reportConfig.setMinimumIdle(2);
reportConfig.setConnectionTimeout(5000);
reportConfig.setIdleTimeout(600000);
HikariDataSource reportDataSource = new HikariDataSource(reportConfig);
```

**Pros:** Prevents reporting queries from starving OLTP operations
**Cons:** Requires multiple connection pools, more complex configuration

